# Plasma 6 session runtime: the package lists only pulled the data packages
# (kwin-common, kwin-data, plasma-desktoptheme), so the image had no
# compositor and no shell. These provide plasmashell, kwin_wayland, kwin_x11
# and the screen configuration KCM.
plasma-workspace
kwin-wayland
kwin-x11
kscreen
plasma-desktop
sddm
sddm-theme-debian-breeze
